  "title": "Auditory single word recognition in MEG",
  "description": "Magnetoencephalography (MEG) recordings from participants performing auditory single word recognition. The dataset accompanies a study of auditory word comprehension in isolated words and is organized in BIDS format. Stimuli and TextGrids come from the Massive Auditory Lexical Decision database.",
  "methods_description": "MEG data were collected during an auditory word recognition task using stimuli from the Massive Auditory Lexical Decision database. Data were converted to BIDS format using MNE-BIDS.",
